==Parameters==
; <code>bgcolor     =</code>
: <nowiki>{{＃}}</nowiki>000000 to <nowiki>{{＃}}</nowiki>ffffff. Usage of rgb, rgba, X11 color names, and hsl value is accommodated.
: note: please use <nowiki>{{＃}}</nowiki> template if you use hex code. This applies to bgsecondary, textcolor, and textsecondary too.
; <code>bgsecondary =</code>
: <nowiki>{{＃}}</nowiki>000000 to <nowiki>{{＃}}</nowiki>ffffff. Usage of rgb, rgba, X11 color names, and hsl value is accommodated.
; <code>textcolor     =</code>
: <nowiki>{{＃}}</nowiki>000000 to <nowiki>{{＃}}</nowiki>ffffff. Usage of rgb, rgba, X11 color names, and hsl value is accommodated.
; <code>textsecondary =</code>
: <nowiki>{{＃}}</nowiki>000000 to <nowiki>{{＃}}</nowiki>ffffff. Usage of rgb, rgba, X11 color names, and hsl value is accommodated.
; <code>ytvideo     =</code>
: The embeded YouTube video to display. If this parameter exist, image will be hidden.
; <code>nicovideo     =</code>
: The embeded Nico Video to display. If this parameter exist, image will be hidden.
; <code>ytvideodesc     =</code>
: The embeded YouTube video description.
; <code>nicovideodesc     =</code>
: The embeded Nico Video description.
; <code>image     =</code>
: The file name of an image to display. If either ytvideo or nicovideo parameter exist, it will be hidden.
; <code>songtitle     =</code>
: To title Song, add <code><nowiki>"'''This Format'''"</nowiki></code>.
: To title translations use plain text format below it.
; <code>original upload date      =</code>
: The month, date, and year the song was first published.
: To hide this section add&nbsp;<code> date      = none</code>
; <code>#views     =</code>
: To link views add this format&nbsp;{{t|V|abbr|NUM}}.
: To hide this section add&nbsp;<code> views     = none</code>
; <code>singer   =</code>
: To link [[Utaite]], add <code><nowiki>[[This Format]]</nowiki></code>.
: To link wikis see [[:Template:Interwiki/doc|Interwiki/doc]] for more information.
; <code>producer =</code>
: To link [[Producer]]s add <code><nowiki>[[This Format]]</nowiki></code> or <code><nowiki>[https://x.com/x_username This Format]</nowiki></code>.
: To link wikis see [[:Template:Interwiki/doc|Interwiki/doc]] for more information.
; <code>link     =</code>
: To link websites add this format&nbsp;{{t|LL|abbr|URL}}.
: To hide this section add&nbsp; <code>links     = none</code>
; <code>description     =</code>
: use plain text format.

